-### D7 独立前置：现有 Context 文件准备的分配门禁
-
-现有 loaded Context 的 skills/catalog、plan/notes、AGENTS/agent memory 文件阶段复用同一个实际 InputEvidenceBudgetLedger completion guard，按原 hard bounds（至多 64 MiB/65536 native records）在文件 buffer、目录项和解析集合分配之前检查。同步 TLS 入口仅包住实际同步文件阶段，不跨 await；可选 reader 吞掉文件错误时仍由原 phase 的最终检查拒绝预算失败。guard 保留原峰值至 EffectivePrompt 最后 holder/reprojection 释放，不新注册同份材料。
-
-本前置保留原文件读取、plan 创建、错误和业务权限，不建立 Ready/resource registry，不宣称 ordinary zero-file-read 或整个 Context 的跨领域累计预算已完成。版本观察、known-write/物理完成与安装 fence 另行接入。
+### Context resource read allowance
+
+Synchronous catalog, plan, notes, guidance and agent-memory reads share one
+resource allowance backed by the Runtime's existing ledger. File buffers,
+directory entries, parser collections and cached catalog copies are admitted
+before allocation. Thread-local entries cover synchronous operations only;
+latched quota failures remain typed and retryable even when an optional reader
+omits an unreadable source. The original guard retains the observed peak through
+the last prompt or reprojection holder. File permissions, optional absence,
+plan creation, business outcomes and ordinary read behavior are preserved.
